{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"26320fee-930f-4f5b-ad2e-29d4a4e9dedc","status":"SUCCESS","response":"All four modules have been fixed and verified against the contract and concurrency/rollback invariants:\n\n- **[models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_26512_1795168474149_baseline/models.py)**: Added `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at` fields to `Job`, enforced attempt bounds and status-specific lease invariants in `__post_init__`, and implemented `validate_transition` raising `InvalidTransitionError` on disallowed transitions.\n- **[retry.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_26512_1795168474149_baseline/retry.py)**: Implemented `compute_backoff` with input validation (rejecting negative values and booleans), overflow-safe exponential cap calculation (`min(cap, base * 2 ** attempt)`), and deterministic full-jitter sampling via `rng.uniform(0.0, upper)`.\n- **[queue_store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_26512_1795168474149_baseline/queue_store.py)**: Wrapped `claim_next_job`, `complete_job`, `fail_job`, and `reclaim_expired_leases` in atomic `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transactions with automatic rollback on failure, ensuring concurrent workers never claim the same job, failed completions leave zero partial `COMPLETED` audit rows, and expired leases or exhausted retries transition cleanly to `PENDING` or `DLQ`.\n- **[worker.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_26512_1795168474149_baseline/worker.py)**: Updated `WorkerPool.process_one` and `run_until_empty` to reclaim expired leases, compute seeded full-jitter backoff on handler exceptions, invoke `store.fail_job(...)`, and coordinate concurrent worker threads until all pending and retryable jobs complete or reach `DLQ`.\n","duration_seconds":141.9989029,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":52836,"output_tokens":10830,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":284178,"total_tokens":63666}}}
